---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const breadcrumbs = [
  { text: "Home", href: "/" },
  { text: "Demo", href: "/layout-demo" },
  { text: "Layout Showcase", href: "/layout-demo" }
];

// Sidebar content was removed - not needed for this demo page
---

<Layout
  title="Layout & Navigation Demo"
  showBreadcrumb={true}
  showSidebar={true}
>
  <!-- Breadcrumb Slot -->
  <ol slot="breadcrumb">
    {breadcrumbs.map((crumb, index) => (
      <li>
        {index === breadcrumbs.length - 1 ? (
          <span class="current">{crumb.text}</span>
        ) : (
          <a href={crumb.href}>{crumb.text}</a>
        )}
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <div class="layout-demo">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <h1>Modern Layout & Navigation</h1>
      <p>Responsive, accessible, and beautiful design for the Code198x platform</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2 id="navigation">🧭 Navigation System</h2>
      <p>The new navigation system provides a modern, accessible experience across all devices:</p>
      
      <div class="cards-grid cards-grid--2">
        <div>
          <h3>Desktop Navigation</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Horizontal navigation bar with logo</li>
            <li>Active page indicators</li>
            <li>Search and theme toggle buttons</li>
            <li>Sticky positioning for easy access</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h3>Mobile Navigation</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Hamburger menu with smooth animations</li>
            <li>Slide-out panel with overlay</li>
            <li>Touch-friendly tap targets</li>
            <li>Automatic menu closing on navigation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2 id="responsive">📱 Responsive Design</h2>
      <p>Built mobile-first with three main breakpoints to ensure optimal experience on any device:</p>
      
      <div>
        <div>
          <div>
            <div>📱</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Mobile (&lt; 768px)</strong><br>
              <span>Single column, stacked navigation, touch-optimized</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <div>💻</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Tablet (768px - 1024px)</strong><br>
              <span>Two columns, horizontal navigation, balanced layout</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <div>🖥️</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Desktop (> 1024px)</strong><br>
              <span>Full layout with optional sidebar, maximum content width</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2 id="accessibility">♿ Accessibility Features</h2>
      <p>Built to WCAG AA standards with comprehensive accessibility support:</p>
      
      <div class="cards-grid cards-grid--3">
        <div>
          <div>⌨️</div>
          <h3>Keyboard Navigation</h3>
          <p>Full keyboard accessibility with visible focus indicators and logical tab order.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <div>🎨</div>
          <h3>High Contrast</h3>
          <p>All color combinations meet WCAG AA contrast requirements (4.5:1 minimum).</p>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <div>📖</div>
          <h3>Screen Readers</h3>
          <p>Semantic HTML, ARIA labels, and proper heading hierarchy for assistive technology.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <strong>Try it out:</strong> 
        <span>Use Tab to navigate, press Enter on the hamburger menu (mobile), or try the skip link at the top.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2 id="footer">🦶 Footer Design</h2>
      <p>The footer provides comprehensive site navigation and information while maintaining visual hierarchy:</p>
      
      <div>
        <div>
          <div>
            <div></div>
            <span><strong>Brand section</strong> with social links and description</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div></div>
            <span><strong>Organized navigation</strong> in logical groupings</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div></div>
            <span><strong>Legal links</strong> and copyright in footer bottom</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div></div>
            <span><strong>Responsive grid</strong> that adapts from 1 to 4 columns</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>🎨 Visual Improvements</h2>
      <p>The new layout eliminates the "ugly" aspects with modern design principles:</p>
      
      <div>
        <div>
          <div>✨</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Clean Typography</strong><br>
            <span>Consistent spacing, proper hierarchy, and readable font sizes</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <div>🎯</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Better Visual Hierarchy</strong><br>
            <span>Clear content organization with proper spacing and visual weight</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <div>🌈</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Consistent Color System</strong><br>
            <span>Unified design tokens across all components and pages</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <div>⚡</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Smooth Interactions</strong><br>
            <span>Subtle animations and hover states that enhance usability</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

